{
  "_port_note": "Reaches the player through the assigned Customer Rep — Ekip §10.4: 'bir müşteri olayı ateşlendiğinde bu olay onun aracılığıyla oyuncuya ulaşır'. The condition reads B2BSalesSystem's own `cs_escalated` fact rather than re-deriving it from a satisfaction threshold, so it cannot drift from the system's hysteresis. Tagged critical because the rep raising the alarm is the edge, and the sweep — not the weighted pool — is what fires on an edge the same day it appears. 'Ask them to be patient' exists so a locked promise never leaves 'No' as the only open row: refusing the rep's word is what ENDS the account, so 'No' churns it.",
